*> Generalized linear mixed models: a binomial (logistic) model on the penguins data,
*> then a Poisson model on simulated multi-store counts, with BLUPs and predictions.
*> The simulation uses FUNCTION RANDOM, so its numbers differ from other languages' runs.
*> Run with `just run-cobol TARGET=glmm_ex`.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GLMM-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

78 N-STORES VALUE 25.
01 TRUE-INTERCEPT USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 2.0.
01 TRUE-SLOPE     USAGE COMP-2 VALUE 0.3.

*> Complete penguin rows: is_male, body mass and island.
01 PENGUIN-ROWS.
   05 IS-MALE-COL   USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 344.
   05 BODY-MASS-COL USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 344.
01 N-PENGUINS USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
*> Each store's deviation from the population intercept (log scale).
01 STORE-EFFECTS.
   05 STORE-EFFECT USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 25.
*> The simulated days: up to 25 stores x 25 days.
01 STORE-DAYS.
   05 STORE-COL  USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 625.
   05 PROMO-COL  USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 625.
   05 VISITS-COL USAGE COMP-2 OCCURS 625.
01 N-DAYS-TOTAL USAGE BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.

01 PENGUINS        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 SEX-DF          USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 SEX-MODEL       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 DF              USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 STORE-MODEL     USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 GROUP-LABELS    USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 RANDOM-EFFECTS  USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 NEWDATA         USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 PREDICTION      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 NROWS           USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 ROW             USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 S               USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 I               USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 K               USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 N-DAYS          USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 GROUP-INDEX     USAGE BINARY-LONG.
01 COMPLETE        PIC X.
01 PROMO-INTENSITY USAGE COMP-2.
01 LAM             USAGE COMP-2.
01 L-THRESH        USAGE COMP-2.
01 P               USAGE COMP-2.
01 GAUSS-VALUE     USAGE COMP-2.
01 U1              USAGE COMP-2.
01 U2              USAGE COMP-2.
01 COLUMN-NAME     PIC X(32).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY "=================== Binomial (logistic) mixed model on a real dataset (penguins) ==================="
    *> Predicting sex from body mass, grouped by island: unlike species (almost perfectly
    *> confounded with island here -- Gentoo penguins occur on Biscoe island only), sex
    *> is not tied to location, so this is a well-behaved fit.
    CALL "dm_data_frame_penguins" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-PENGUINS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-PENGUINS-RESULT TO PENGUINS
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-SELF
    CALL "dm_data_frame_nrows" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NROWS-RESULT TO NROWS
    *> Island names go straight into the VECTOR-STRING-TABLE.
    PERFORM VARYING ROW FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL ROW >= NROWS
        MOVE "Y" TO COMPLETE
        MOVE "sex" TO COLUMN-NAME
        PERFORM CHECK-NULL
        MOVE "body_mass_g" TO COLUMN-NAME
        PERFORM CHECK-NULL
        MOVE "island" TO COLUMN-NAME
        PERFORM CHECK-NULL
        IF COMPLETE = "Y"
            ADD 1 TO N-PENGUINS
            MOVE "sex" TO COLUMN-NAME
            PERFORM STRING-AT
            IF DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT(1:DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH) = "male"
                MOVE 1.0 TO IS-MALE-COL(N-PENGUINS)
            ELSE
                MOVE 0.0 TO IS-MALE-COL(N-PENGUINS)
            END-IF
            MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-SELF
            MOVE "body_mass_g" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-COLUMN-NAME
            MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-ROW-INDEX
            CALL "dm_data_frame_numeric_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT DM-STATUS
            PERFORM CHECK
            MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NUMERIC-AT-RESULT TO BODY-MASS-COL(N-PENGUINS)
            MOVE "island" TO COLUMN-NAME
            PERFORM STRING-AT
            MOVE N-PENGUINS TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-COUNT
            MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM(N-PENGUINS)
            MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT-LENGTH
                TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-ITEM-LENGTH(N-PENGUINS)
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM

    CALL "dm_data_frame_new" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW-RESULT TO SEX-DF
    MOVE SEX-DF TO DF
    MOVE N-PENGUINS TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N-PENGUINS
        MOVE IS-MALE-COL(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE "is_male" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N-PENGUINS
        MOVE BODY-MASS-COL(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE "body_mass_g" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    CALL "dm_vector_string_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE SEX-DF TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-STRING-COLUMN-SELF
    MOVE "island" TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-STRING-COLUMN-COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-SELF TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-STRING-COLUMN-VALUES
    CALL "dm_data_frame_add_string_column" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-STRING-COLUMN DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-STRING-TABLE-SELF TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    MOVE SEX-DF TO DM-GLMM-NEW-DATA
    MOVE "is_male ~ body_mass_g + (1 | island)" TO DM-GLMM-NEW-FORMULA
    MOVE 3 TO DM-GLMM-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE "binomial" TO DM-GLMM-NEW-FAMILY
    CALL "dm_glmm_new" USING DM-GLMM-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GLMM-NEW-RESULT TO SEX-MODEL
    MOVE SEX-MODEL TO DM-GLMM-PRINT-SUMMARY-SELF
    CALL "dm_glmm_print_summary" USING DM-GLMM-PRINT-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "=================== Poisson mixed model on simulated multi-site count data ==================="
    *> 25 stores, ~20 days each: daily visit counts depend on a promo intensity score, but
    *> both the baseline traffic and the promo's effectiveness vary by store.
    MOVE FUNCTION RANDOM(4242) TO U1
    PERFORM VARYING S FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL S > N-STORES
        PERFORM GAUSS
        COMPUTE STORE-EFFECT(S) = GAUSS-VALUE * 0.4
    END-PERFORM
    PERFORM VARYING S FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL S > N-STORES
        *> 15 to 25 days.
        COMPUTE N-DAYS = 15 + FUNCTION INTEGER(FUNCTION RANDOM * 11)
        PERFORM N-DAYS TIMES
            COMPUTE PROMO-INTENSITY = FUNCTION RANDOM * 3.0
            COMPUTE LAM = FUNCTION EXP(TRUE-INTERCEPT + STORE-EFFECT(S)
                + TRUE-SLOPE * PROMO-INTENSITY)
            *> Knuth's Poisson sampler.
            COMPUTE L-THRESH = FUNCTION EXP(- LAM)
            MOVE 0 TO K
            MOVE 1.0 TO P
            PERFORM WITH TEST AFTER UNTIL P <= L-THRESH
                ADD 1 TO K
                COMPUTE P = P * FUNCTION RANDOM
            END-PERFORM
            ADD 1 TO N-DAYS-TOTAL
            COMPUTE STORE-COL(N-DAYS-TOTAL) = S - 1
            MOVE PROMO-INTENSITY TO PROMO-COL(N-DAYS-TOTAL)
            COMPUTE VISITS-COL(N-DAYS-TOTAL) = K - 1
        END-PERFORM
    END-PERFORM

    CALL "dm_data_frame_new" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW-RESULT TO DF
    MOVE N-DAYS-TOTAL TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N-DAYS-TOTAL
        MOVE STORE-COL(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE "store" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N-DAYS-TOTAL
        MOVE PROMO-COL(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE "promo" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    PERFORM VARYING I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL I > N-DAYS-TOTAL
        MOVE VISITS-COL(I) TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(I)
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE "visits" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN

    MOVE DF TO DM-GLMM-NEW-DATA
    MOVE "visits ~ promo + (1 | store)" TO DM-GLMM-NEW-FORMULA
    MOVE "poisson" TO DM-GLMM-NEW-FAMILY
    CALL "dm_glmm_new" USING DM-GLMM-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GLMM-NEW-RESULT TO STORE-MODEL
    MOVE STORE-MODEL TO DM-GLMM-PRINT-SUMMARY-SELF
    CALL "dm_glmm_print_summary" USING DM-GLMM-PRINT-SUMMARY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "True generating values: intercept=" TRUE-INTERCEPT ", slope=" TRUE-SLOPE
        ", random-intercept SD (log scale)=0.4"

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "--- BLUPs for a few stores ---"
    MOVE STORE-MODEL TO DM-GLMM-GROUP-LABELS-SELF
    CALL "dm_glmm_group_labels" USING DM-GLMM-GROUP-LABELS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GLMM-GROUP-LABELS-RESULT TO GROUP-LABELS
    PERFORM VARYING GROUP-INDEX FROM 0 BY 1 UNTIL GROUP-INDEX > 2
        MOVE GROUP-LABELS TO DM-VECTOR-STRING-SELF
        COMPUTE DM-VECTOR-STRING-INDEX = GROUP-INDEX + 1
        CALL "dm_vector_string_get" USING DM-VECTOR-STRING DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE STORE-MODEL TO DM-GLMM-RANDOM-EFFECTS-FOR-GROUP-SELF
        MOVE GROUP-INDEX TO DM-GLMM-RANDOM-EFFECTS-FOR-GROUP-GROUP-INDEX
        CALL "dm_glmm_random_effects_for_group" USING DM-GLMM-RANDOM-EFFECTS-FOR-GROUP DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        MOVE DM-GLMM-RANDOM-EFFECTS-FOR-GROUP-RESULT TO RANDOM-EFFECTS
        MOVE RANDOM-EFFECTS TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF
        MOVE 1 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-INDEX
        CALL "dm_vector_double_get" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
        PERFORM CHECK
        DISPLAY "store " DM-VECTOR-STRING-VALUE(1:DM-VECTOR-STRING-VALUE-LENGTH)
            ": intercept shift=" DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE
        MOVE RANDOM-EFFECTS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
        CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    END-PERFORM
    MOVE GROUP-LABELS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS

    DISPLAY " "
    DISPLAY "--- Prediction: population-level vs. store-adjusted ---"
    *> promo alone: fixed effects only.
    CALL "dm_data_frame_new" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-FRAME-NEW-RESULT TO NEWDATA
    MOVE NEWDATA TO DF
    MOVE 1 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-COUNT
    MOVE 1.5 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(1)
    MOVE "promo" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    PERFORM PREDICT-FIRST
    DISPLAY "promo=1.5, unseen store:   " DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE
        " expected visits (fixed effects only)"
    *> Adding store 0 brings in that store's BLUP.
    MOVE 0.0 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-ITEM(1)
    MOVE "store" TO COLUMN-NAME
    PERFORM ADD-COLUMN
    PERFORM PREDICT-FIRST
    DISPLAY "promo=1.5, store 0 (known): " DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE
        " expected visits (fixed effects + store 0's BLUP)"

    MOVE NEWDATA TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE STORE-MODEL TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE SEX-MODEL TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE SEX-DF TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.

*> COMPLETE becomes "N" when penguins COLUMN-NAME is null at ROW.
CHECK-NULL.
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-IS-NULL-SELF
    MOVE COLUMN-NAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-IS-NULL-COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-IS-NULL-ROW-INDEX
    CALL "dm_data_frame_is_null" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-IS-NULL DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    IF DM-DATA-FRAME-IS-NULL-RESULT = 1
        MOVE "N" TO COMPLETE
    END-IF.

*> Reads penguins COLUMN-NAME at ROW into DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-RESULT.
STRING-AT.
    MOVE PENGUINS TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-SELF
    MOVE COLUMN-NAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE ROW TO DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT-ROW-INDEX
    CALL "dm_data_frame_string_at" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-STRING-AT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK.

*> DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-VALUE gets STORE-MODEL's first prediction for NEWDATA.
PREDICT-FIRST.
    MOVE STORE-MODEL TO DM-GLMM-PREDICT-SELF
    MOVE NEWDATA TO DM-GLMM-PREDICT-NEWDATA
    CALL "dm_glmm_predict" USING DM-GLMM-PREDICT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GLMM-PREDICT-RESULT TO PREDICTION
    MOVE PREDICTION TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-SELF
    MOVE 1 TO DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-INDEX
    CALL "dm_vector_double_get" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE PREDICTION TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Adds the VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE items as column COLUMN-NAME of DF.
ADD-COLUMN.
    CALL "dm_vector_double_from_table" USING DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DF TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-SELF
    MOVE COLUMN-NAME TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-COLUMN-NAME
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN-VALUES
    CALL "dm_data_frame_add_numeric_column" USING DM-DATA-FRAME-ADD-NUMERIC-COLUMN DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-VECTOR-DOUBLE-TABLE-SELF TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> GAUSS-VALUE gets a standard normal draw (Box-Muller).
GAUSS.
    MOVE FUNCTION RANDOM TO U1
    MOVE FUNCTION RANDOM TO U2
    COMPUTE GAUSS-VALUE = FUNCTION SQRT(-2.0 * FUNCTION LOG(U1))
        * FUNCTION COS(2.0 * FUNCTION PI * U2).

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
